  <item>
    <title>为什么你赚钱总是很辛苦？突破金钱剧本里的限制性信念｜和严艺家聊「金钱心理学」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae9217c30b2f21e462b660b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae9217c30b2f21e462b660b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 23:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8206376983_4621315.png?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1280/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8206376983_4621315.png" alt="image.png"></picture></figure></div><p><span>关于「金钱」，你有自己的迷思吗？反正我一直有两个问题：1、为什么学金融，却害怕理财？2、为什么总是赚钱很辛苦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>然后我像掉进兔子洞，继续问自己：你觉得这个世界是安全的还是危险的？你相信自己有能力获得想要的东西吗？你觉得自己配得上多少财富？你能不能坦然接受别人的帮助？你是否相信一定要付出非常辛苦的努力才能赚到很多钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>好，如果你对这些问题都没有明确答案，那么欢迎一起进入本期</span><strong><span>「金钱心理学」</span></strong><span>的探索， Financial Therapy。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接着我花了一个半月，和 AI 协作梳理了一份自己的「金钱生命史」。重点不是赚了多少、亏了多少，而是当时发生了什么、我为什么那么选、它在我身上留下了什么。如果你对这个探索过程，比如写了什么prompt、做了哪些测试、经历哪些卡点和转折感兴趣，欢迎在评论区留言告诉我，有机会我录一期单口~</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这一期，我请来了精神分析心理治疗博士候选人严艺家。她在「金钱」这个话题上尤其有研究（往下听你就知道为什么了😁</span></p><span></span><p><span>艺家说，她正在把自己从“不断被压榨的油田，变成可以轮换着休息、自产自足的有机农场”——这大概也是我很向往的金钱状态，甚至是人生状态。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📢【找到我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><div class="blockquote"><blockquote><p><span>🍠</span><strong><span>小红书</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/653b42ea000000000d005980?xsec_token=YBHfRbgMkA4k013mUaWQ4xKb46jMvFXMvphDbP2aT54Lk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5d81b88400000000010032c1&amp;apptime=1772516974&amp;share_id=d59c5bc2b5dd42648758717a2e495fa9&amp;wechatWid=c779bc1214ba59845255cfb3dc71a289&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/653b42ea000000000d005980?xsec_token=YBHfRbgMkA4k013mUaWQ4xKb46jMvFXMvphDbP2aT54Lk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5d81b88400000000010032c1&amp;apptime=1772516974&amp;share_id=d59c5bc2b5dd42648758717a2e495fa9&amp;wechatWid=c779bc1214ba59845255cfb3dc71a289&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@天才女友外出偷马 </span></a></p><span></span></blockquote></div><span></span><p><span>金句笔记、视频播客、主播日常</span></p><span></span><div class="blockquote"><blockquote><p><span>🌏</span><strong><span>微信号</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>tiancaitouma</span></strong></p><span></span></blockquote></div><span></span><p><span>投稿连线，围观朋友圈，加入社群</span></p><span></span><div class="blockquote"><blockquote><p><span>🍠我的小号</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6258cce60000000021020c07?xsec_token=ABkPkCjOUSugse3ggZPoG41Rk-mPCO5gI4D02qAkur9QQ=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search&amp;wechatWid=c779bc1214ba59845255cfb3dc71a289&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6258cce60000000021020c07?xsec_token=ABkPkCjOUSugse3ggZPoG41Rk-mPCO5gI4D02qAkur9QQ=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search&amp;wechatWid=c779bc1214ba59845255cfb3dc71a289&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@Ming吃夜草会肥</span></a></p><span></span></blockquote></div><span></span><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8206376890_2778015.png?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_983/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8206376890_2778015.png" alt="image.png"></picture></figure></div><p><strong><span>互动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>金钱剧本测试👉🏻</span><a href="https://www.bradklontz.com/moneyscriptstest" data-url="https://www.bradklontz.com/moneyscriptstest"><span>www.bradklontz.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果你还没有清晰的「金钱剧本」，推荐可以做做这个测试~</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然每个人都是独一无二、无法被分类的存在，但这个测试的提问和选项，或许可以触发你去梳理自己和金钱背后关系的思考❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>做了测试的马友友，欢迎回评论区分享答案呀🐎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=00:17"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a></span></span><span> 学金融的我，为什么不敢打开自己的银行理财账户？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=07:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a></span></span><span> 金钱是"玩"的综合体现</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=15:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a></span></span><span> 我正尝试从"不断开采的油田"转变为"自己生长的有机农场"</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=20:02"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a></span></span><span> 金钱剧本是“八字”写好的，但人有“能动性”</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=22:14"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a></span></span><span> 不敢all in的人，是不敢拥有一个只属于他的完整的东西？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=31:41"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a></span></span><span> 财富自由，你觉得是挣多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=53:28"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3208">53:28</a></span></span><span> 此刻你面前有 100 万现金，你的身体是什么感觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:00:31"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3631">01:00:31</a></span></span><span> 金钱剧本-1：不理财，因为我还想继续做孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:01:42"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3702">01:01:42</a></span></span><span> 金钱剧本-2：二代的魔咒，打败父母，是不可想象的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:21:15"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4875">01:21:15</a></span></span><span> 说到"挣钱"，你脑子里第一个蹦出来的人是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:28:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5320">01:28:40</a></span></span><span> 金钱的限制性信念后台代码，还能修改吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:39:43"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5983">01:39:43</a></span></span><span> 和AI共同探索“金钱生命史”</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=02:31:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9100">02:31:40</a></span></span><span> 赚钱一定要靠努力吗？显化就能带来财富？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=02:35:19"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9319">02:35:19</a></span></span><span> 钱是我的闺蜜：她知道我所有的烂事，但依然爱我</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提及</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>视频，天才女友GG，《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qc411h7fH/?spm_id_from=333.1387.collection.video_card.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qc411h7fH/?spm_id_from=333.1387.collection.video_card.click"><span>全球财富排名1%的“豪三代”的真实人生（上）</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频，天才女友GG，《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16Q4y1K7tx/?spm_id_from=333.1387.collection.video_card.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16Q4y1K7tx/?spm_id_from=333.1387.collection.video_card.click"><span>全球财富排名1%的“豪三代”的真实人生（下）</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>书，《我如何搞垮巴林银行》</span></p><span></span><p><span>书，《On Giving Up》，Adam Phillips</span></p><span></span><p><span>书，《对财富说是》，奥南朵</span></p><span></span><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8215446058_585309.png?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1280/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/geniusgirls/8215446058_585309.png" alt="alt text"></picture></figure></div>]]></description>
