    <title>148︳小时候被塞上绿皮火车，长大了在伦敦爬雪山：童年旅行经验的无意识影响有多大</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a01aaa01b7bd50295ed0391</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a01aaa01b7bd50295ed0391</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 10:19:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>未成年时期或近或远的旅行体验如何在无意识层面影响塑造着我们成年后的心灵世界？本期节目我将从一些童年回忆出发，邀请大家一起展开自由联想。旅行对儿童青少年而言不仅仅是认知层面的意义，更是内在心灵世界的“小剂量”拓展体验。当一家人需要短暂居于不同的时空、节奏、文化圈层、人际关系，经历种种不可预期的场景，一个孩子身处其中会有怎样的体验？也许这期节目会给正在思考暑期旅行计划的养育者们一些启发。</span></p><p><span>节目中我提到的用了10年的亲子游学机构公众号【美伴文化】，听友专属福利请见评论区置顶。</span></p><p><span>2026国内夏令营产品汇总：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5OTIwMTEwNQ==&amp;mid=2650646050&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b5166fe81f607e1a82cd6044cab307b8&amp;chksm=891c76e62c6dae8387f1e424bfe724125bfaf7e5ccf4d08e12043f21c195f30d763c2d4ff15e&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=1&amp;srcid=0511xS0kWUPZdQwOzhWV82Ua&amp;sharer_shareinfo=d665a02afee4b46de9155c8cbfc24bd7&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=d665a02afee4b46de9155c8cbfc24bd7&amp;exportkey=n_ChQIAhIQN0D%2FTorCbYAflH4lHrDPBRL1AQIE97dBBAEAAAAAAD%2BnDdAMSfkAAAAOpnltbLcz9gKNyK89dVj0%2Bh%2FSEZVewMNYRWaAtVqqwKftetMpVQd7V4q4Drs%2B8tBY7xg9oaRwvmMK2jV1l1HFZDtIytwrN6VdYqwvEX1QsNxl%2B%2FvPRgNwoV27IcKWCvEbgCDgB5i93TpQsOXtozkBnxO%2BuByV1MYCXjcy0frcrsgMYmAmkqCE8njPjNY6cnBAqi6uL9RPLBZfzwJGhqn9wRMV0cJdrpkxHuhmH8NImpJyah8dB6F3EFeCpxENmPKp7DTOrs3gUSQYjrrP03UgeeKcSo0kw9INI5K9yCDJ&amp;acctmode=0&amp;pass_ticket=QE44VpZuPfo9JAbQfpOu%2FuHEHaGDD30knO0mXCpO75gmjrghAtteMpGLRn0uZ2GL&amp;wx_header=0#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5OTIwMTEwNQ==&amp;mid=2650646050&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b5166fe81f607e1a82cd6044cab307b8&amp;chksm=891c76e62c6dae8387f1e424bfe724125bfaf7e5ccf4d08e12043f21c195f30d763c2d4ff15e&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=1&amp;srcid=0511xS0kWUPZdQwOzhWV82Ua&amp;sharer_shareinfo=d665a02afee4b46de9155c8cbfc24bd7&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=d665a02afee4b46de9155c8cbfc24bd7&amp;exportkey=n_ChQIAhIQN0D%2FTorCbYAflH4lHrDPBRL1AQIE97dBBAEAAAAAAD%2BnDdAMSfkAAAAOpnltbLcz9gKNyK89dVj0%2Bh%2FSEZVewMNYRWaAtVqqwKftetMpVQd7V4q4Drs%2B8tBY7xg9oaRwvmMK2jV1l1HFZDtIytwrN6VdYqwvEX1QsNxl%2B%2FvPRgNwoV27IcKWCvEbgCDgB5i93TpQsOXtozkBnxO%2BuByV1MYCXjcy0frcrsgMYmAmkqCE8njPjNY6cnBAqi6uL9RPLBZfzwJGhqn9wRMV0cJdrpkxHuhmH8NImpJyah8dB6F3EFeCpxENmPKp7DTOrs3gUSQYjrrP03UgeeKc